        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-72810\"><b>Laurey 72810, 7/8 Inch Square Champagne Brass Cosmopolitan Knob</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7/8 Inch Square Champagne Brass Cosmopolitan Knob has a transitional style that is great for most kitchens. The Champagne Brass finish is very popular right now. This Square Champagne Brass Cosmopolitan Knob features a square inlay that will add interest to any lightweight door or drawer. The 7/8 Square Cabinet Knob Champagne Brass comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Cosmopolitan\">Laurey Cosmopolitan Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 72810 Champagne Brass Square Cosmopolitan Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Champagne Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-72810\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-72810-sm.jpg?v=1704354643\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-72810\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/7-8-square-cabinet-knob-oil-rubbed-bronze-laurey-72866\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-72866-sm.jpg?v=1704354602\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-72866\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/7-8-square-cabinet-knob-polished-chrome-laurey-72826\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-72826-sm.jpg?v=1704354643\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-72826\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/7-8-square-cabinet-knob-satin-nickel-laurey-72828\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857